  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 3 ranks, Faction sphere ((retainer) package, (supply) package, Magical Armory, either Armed Retainer or Roguish Retainer).</p>\n<p>You can choose an assassin, bounty hunter, or other skilled combatant as your faction retainer.</p>\n<p><strong>Skilled Mercenary</strong><br>\n<strong>Role 2 Authorizations</strong> Defend a defensible position (combatant with equipment), <strong>3 Authorizations</strong> Fight in any other combat (without likely death or betraying the faction) (combatant with equipment);<br>\n<strong>Skills</strong> (2 primary, 6 secondary) Acrobatics, Bluff, Climb, Diplomacy, Disable Device, Escape Artist, Heal, Intimidate, Knowledge (local or nature, chosen individually), Perception, Sense Motive, Sleight of Hand, Stealth, Survival, Swim; <strong>Statistics</strong> The mercenary otherwise uses standard statistics and equipment for an NPC assassin, bard, ninja, or rogue with character level up to your retainer Hit Dice maximum.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/faction#toc61\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
